Third-party components shipped inside the built artifacts

This package bundles PDF.js (package `pdfjs-dist`, version 6.3.289), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. PDF.js code is embedded in the
generated `lib/host.js`, `client.pdf.js` and the copied `lib/pdf.worker.mjs`.
The full Apache-2.0 license text and the required attribution / statement of
modification are supplied verbatim in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md at the repository
root. That file must be listed in `files` when publishing; see
docs/PUBLISHING.md.
